- LocalEnvironment.submit delegates JobManager.submit_job, which compiles and calls CompiledActorGraph.submit; FlowNetEnvironment uses the same compiler directly.
- CompiledActorGraph.submit(True) runs batch synchronously. False creates one threading.Thread per source and returns a handle; root completion cannot be inferred from submit return. _run_source_thread catches exceptions and logs them; finally checks globally enumerated source threads (a pre-existing lifecycle issue, out of this trace-only scope).
- Generic DAG path: _dispatch_from_source creates a deque[(transformation,Packet)]; _process_packet directly invokes function.execute, with key/input index handling for join/comap. User payload is arbitrary and may contain credentials or reasoning.
- Linear batch path: _execute_chain async_calls map/filter/flatmap actor method refs and waits future.result; sink uses synchronous calls. local_backend and flownet_backend submit self.call to ThreadPoolExecutor without copy_context. Actor wrappers directly invoke user functions.
- FlowNet ActorInvoker._call_sync_target executes sync target through run_in_executor_with_context. A record.lock guards normal actors; queue timing before executor submit includes waiting for this lock, execution starts after acquiring it.
- WorkflowIntegrationRegistry import_workflow/submit_job/poll_status/collect_result dispatch adapters and validate responses. submit returns accepted job reference; synchronous method span is not external job completion. RAG/tool implementations are optional external packages.
- Chat _request_openai_chat sends OpenAI-compatible urllib Request including Authorization and prompt messages; SSE prints only delta.content, ignores reasoning. Usage comes from response. Direct sagellm is a subprocess, inner spans unavailable unless it participates.
- TraceLoom contract integer schema_version=1 NDJSON: IDs, parent_span_id, producer/clock_id, sequence, wall_time_ns and monotonic_ns, start/end/event/trace_end/metrics; scalar metadata allowlist only. Parentage != dependencies; links only completion-before-start. Longest observed dependency path must be marked partial, not global critical path. Whole-trace sampling, bounded async spool, failure-isolation, no raw content/keys/errors by default. Public summaries need explicit redactor and opt-in. Endpoint and input/output digest references can be opaque evidence_refs. Request context across remote processes needs an explicit validated carrier; no implicit assumption ContextVars propagate over RPC.

